  "document": "So Alive (Skepta and N-Dubz song)\n\"So Alive\" is a song by British MC Skepta and British trio, N-Dubz. It was released as an official single on 6 February 2011. It is the fourth single released Skepta's third album \"Doin' It Again\" and N-Dubz's third album \"Love.Live.Life\". The single peaked at #99 on the UK Singles Chart."
